    <h1>F215343: Rx: Enabler - Correct RX Access for Carved-out Members</h1=
>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"contentLayout2">
<div class=3D"columnLayout fixed-width" data-layout=3D"fixed-width">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<h1 id=3D"F215343:Rx:Enabler-CorrectRXAccessforCarved-outMembers-NGX-F21534=
3:RxEnabler(Arch)=E2=80=93CorrectRXAccessforCarved-outMembers">NGX-F215343:=
 Rx Enabler (Arch) =E2=80=93 Correct RX Access for Carved-out Members</h1>
<h1 id=3D"F215343:Rx:Enabler-CorrectRXAccessforCarved-outMembers-FeatureSum=
mary">Feature Summary</h1>
<p><strong>Objective</strong>: Prevent display or use of pharmacy claims an=
d prescriptions that fall outside a member=E2=80=99s Aetna-covered period w=
hen the member=E2=80=99s pharmacy history originates from CVS Caremark. CVS=
 systems legitimately maintain a longitudinal (lifetime) prescription histo=
ry for an individual, spanning time periods when the person may have had ot=
her insurers or no coverage at Aetna. When Aetna consumes CVS data via the =
Consolidated Claims and related APIs, those lifetime records can include fi=
lls that pre=E2=80=91date (and in some cases post=E2=80=91date) the member=
=E2=80=99s Aetna plan effective dates. If unfiltered, these records would b=
e visible in Aetna Health and could be acted upon by downstream services.</=
p>
<p>Solution: Introduce a Policy Effective Window Filter that gates visibili=
ty and use of any CVS=E2=80=91sourced prescription claim, order, or refill.=
 The filter constrains records to the intersection of: (a) the member=E2=80=
=99s pharmacy membership effective window that aligns with the Aetna plan e=
ffective dates, (b) the client=E2=80=99s requested startDate/endDate, and (=
c) attestation=E2=80=91controlled integration state. Only claims with fillD=
ate within this window are eligible for display and subsequent flows (detai=
l, order, refill). The integration itself is governed by the =E2=80=98CVSRx=
CarveOut=E2=80=99 feature toggle/attestation; when enabled, Aetna presents =
embedded capabilities and SSO; when disabled, Aetna presents a limited, lin=
k=E2=80=91out experience.</p>
