<div class=3D"columnLayout fixed-width" data-layout=3D"fixed-width">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<p></p>
<p>Consolidated Claims</p>
<h1 id=3D"F215343:Rx:Enabler-CorrectRXAccessforCarved-outMembers-ServiceLog=
ic">Service Logic</h1>
<p>The centralized eligibility service enforces claim visibility rules in t=
his order:</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Validate attestation (CVSRxCarveOut) and integration state.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Retrieve CVS token (patient profile), authorizations, family access rule=
s, and privacy entitlements.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Fetch claims and normalize; deduplicate by uniqueRxId keeping the latest=
 fillDate.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Apply Policy Effective Window Filter using pharmacy membership effective=
 dates =E2=88=A9 request window.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Apply family access/UAF privacy restrictions.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Restrict by membershipResourceIds if provided and return mapped response=
s.</p></li>
</ol>
<h1 id=3D"F215343:Rx:Enabler-CorrectRXAccessforCarved-outMembers-Services">=
Services</h1>
<ul>
<li>
<p>CVS Auth Service (patient profile token)</p></li>
<li>
<p>CVS Consolidated Claims Service (GET /hcb/v3/memberships/{id}/consolidat=
edclaims)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Prescription List Service (POST /prescriptions/search; GET /prescription=
s/detail)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Order &amp; Refill Service</p></li>
<li>
<p>Core Proxy (/userauthorizations)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Member Profile (/familyaccessrules)</p></li>
<li>
<p>UAF (privacy)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Centralized Eligibility Middleware (Effective Date &amp; Attestation Fil=
tering)</p></li>
</ul>
<h1 id=3D"F215343:Rx:Enabler-CorrectRXAccessforCarved-outMembers-_Toc207888=
637Non-FunctionalRequirements(NFR)"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" =
id=3D"F215343:Rx:Enabler-CorrectRXAccessforCarved-outMembers-_Toc207888637"=
><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"_Toc207888637"></span></span>=
Non-Functional Requirements (NFR)</h1>
<p>SLOs (Pharmacy Service v1):</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Latency: P95 =E2=89=A4 300 ms (list), =E2=89=A4 250 ms (detail), =E2=89=
=A4 300 ms (evaluate).</p></li>
<li>
<p>Availability: 99.9% monthly; error budget 43m/month.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Partial rate baseline (list): =E2=89=A4 25% in steady state; investigate=
 spikes.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Timeout policy: upstream dependency timeouts at 3s; circuit-breaker afte=
r 5 consecutive timeouts.</p></li>
</ul>
<p><em>Performance: Response =E2=89=A4 200ms under normal load.</em></p>
<p><em>Scalability: Support ~47 APIs and five key integrations.</em></p>
<p><em>Caching: Use deterministic cache keys and TTL aligned with CVS fresh=
ness.</em></p>
<p><em>Observability: Emit metrics and traces for cache hits, trims by wind=
ow, privacy filters, and dedup.</em></p>
<p><em>Reliability: Graceful degradation when dependencies are unavailable.=
</em></p>
<p><em>Required metrics:</em></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>requests_total{endpoint,method}</p></li>
<li>
<p>trimmed_by_effective_window_total</p></li>
<li>
<p>hidden_by_privacy_total, hidden_by_family_total</p></li>
<li>
<p>deduplicated_total</p></li>
<li>
<p>upstream_latency_ms{dependency} (histogram)</p></li>
<li>
<p>end_to_end_latency_ms (histogram)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Traces/Logs:</p></li>
<li>
<p>CorrelationId (EIE transaction id) on every hop</p></li>
<li>
<p>Decision logs at INFO with reasons and counts</p></li>
<li>
<p>Error envelopes with additional_data.failure_id and diagnostics</p></li>
</ul>
<h1 id=3D"F215343:Rx:Enabler-CorrectRXAccessforCarved-outMembers-Observabil=
ity(Metrics,Traces,Logs)">Observability (Metrics, Traces, Logs)</h1>
<h1 id=3D"F215343:Rx:Enabler-CorrectRXAccessforCarved-outMembers-Scenarios"=
>Scenarios</h1>
<h3 id=3D"F215343:Rx:Enabler-CorrectRXAccessforCarved-outMembers-ModeAScena=
rio=E2=80=94PLPlistforAetna-coveredwindow(fetch-and-filter)">Mode A Scenari=
o =E2=80=94 PLP list for Aetna-covered window (fetch-and-filter)</h3>
<p>Client: Aetna Health PLP</p>
<p>Call: <em>POST /v1/prescriptions/search?startDate=3D2019-01-01&amp;endDa=
te=3D2019-12-31</em></p>
<p>Body:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
    "membershipResourceIds": ["5~263801696+31+1+20180101+788678+C+3"],
     "options": {"applyPrivacy": true, "applyFamilyAccess": true, "applyDed=
uplication": true, "requireAttestation": true}
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p>Outcome: returns eligible prescriptions (deduped) for in-window fills; o=
ut-of-window claims are excluded and, if any exist, are listed in additiona=
l_data.partial_failures[] with failure_id=3DCLAIM_OUTSIDE_EFFECTIVE_WINDOW.=
</p>
<h3 id=3D"F215343:Rx:Enabler-CorrectRXAccessforCarved-outMembers-ModeBScena=
rio=E2=80=94ETLvalidatesrawCVSclaims(filter-only)">Mode B Scenario =E2=80=
=94 ETL validates raw CVS claims (filter-only)</h3>
<p>Client: nightly quality job</p>
<p>Call: <em>POST /v1/visibility/evaluate?startDate=3D2019-01-01&amp;endDat=
e=3D2019-12-31&amp;partialAs=3D206</em></p>
<p>Body:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
    "memberContext": {"membershipResourceIds": ["5~263801696+31+1+20180101+=
788678+C+3"], "attestation": {"cvsrxCarveOut": true}},
    "claims": [
      {"claimNumber": "200023611694001", "uniqueRxId": "9751485501674528227=
", "fillDate": "2019-08-12", "membershipResourceId": "5~..."},
      {"claimNumber": "200023611694002", "uniqueRxId": "9751485501674528228=
", "fillDate": "2018-04-12", "membershipResourceId": "5~..."}
    ],
    "options": {"applyPrivacy": true, "applyFamilyAccess": true, "applyDedu=
plication": true}
 }</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p>Outcome: service returns 206 with X-Partial-Result=3Dtrue. decisions[] i=
ncludes the in-window claim as eligible; the out-of-window claim is capture=
d in additional_data.partial_failures[].</p>
<h2 id=3D"F215343:Rx:Enabler-CorrectRXAccessforCarved-outMembers-Partial-su=
ccess(list/batch)scenarios:">Partial-success (list/batch) scenarios:</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Mixed eligibility: return HTTP 200 with additional_data.code=3DPARTIAL_S=
UCCESS by default.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Client may request HTTP 206 via Prefer: partial=3D206 or partialAs=3D206=
.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Eligible items appear in data; excluded items are listed in additional_d=
ata.partial_failures[].</p></li>
<li>
<p>UI: show eligible prescriptions; display a non-blocking info banner: =E2=
=80=9CSome items were hidden due to coverage or privacy.=E2=80=9D</p></li>
</ul>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Prescription claim before coverage effectiveStart =E2=86=92 excluded fro=
m all views and actions.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Refill/order outside coverage window =E2=86=92 blocked with clear messag=
ing.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Member without signed attestation =E2=86=92 link=E2=80=91out (no embedde=
d capabilities).</p></li>
<li>
<p>Member with signed attestation =E2=86=92 full embedded integration.</p><=
/li>
<li>
<p>Missing startDate/endDate =E2=86=92 400 Bad Request with guidance.</p></=
li>
<li>
<p>Sensitive drug + privacy restriction =E2=86=92 excluded per UAF.</p></li=
>
</ol>
<h1 id=3D"F215343:Rx:Enabler-CorrectRXAccessforCarved-outMembers-_Toc207888=
640ClientChanges"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"F215343:Rx:E=
nabler-CorrectRXAccessforCarved-outMembers-_Toc207888640"><span class=3D"co=
nfluence-anchor-link" id=3D"_Toc207888640"></span></span>Client Changes</h1=
>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Integrate with centralized eligibility service for consistent filtering.=
</p></li>
<li>
<p>Enforce and display messaging when items are hidden due to effective dat=
es or privacy.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Respect attestation state to show embedded features vs link=E2=80=91out.=
</p></li>
<li>
<p>Keep UI and mobile parity across platforms.</p></li>
</ul>
